// Settings UI (chat settings, api keys, providers, stages, agents, memory, skills, tools).

%locale: 
%namespace: settings

agent.add: Add new agent

agent.context: Context
agent.copy_to_local: Copy to chat agents
agent.exposure_mode: Exposure mode
agent.exposure_mode.hint: Controls what parts of this agent's messages are visible to other agents.
agent.filter.blacklist: Blacklist
agent.filter.deselect_all: Deselect all
agent.filter.mode: Filter mode:
agent.filter.select_all: Select all
agent.filter.whitelist: Whitelist
agent.global: (global)
agent.max_visible_rounds: Max visible rounds:
agent.max_visible_rounds.hint: Limits how many recent conversation rounds (user message + assistant response) are visible to each agent. 0 means unlimited. Helps manage context window usage.
agent.prompt_mode: Prompt context mode
agent.prompt_mode.hint: How the system prompt is assembled: dynamic (live rebuild each request), hybrid (frozen snapshot + change announcements) or static (snapshot with manual refresh).
agent.prompt_mode.dynamic: Dynamic
agent.prompt_mode.hybrid: Hybrid
agent.prompt_mode.static: Static
agent.checkpoint.disabled_flags: Disabled checkpoints
agent.checkpoint.disabled_flags.hint: Checkpoint kinds that this agent ignores.
agent.checkpoint.shield: Context shields
agent.checkpoint.shield.hint: Cut off the history until the shield message.
agent.checkpoint.summary: Summaries
agent.checkpoint.summary.hint: Replace the cut-off history with a summary.
agent.checkpoint.tool_compaction: Tool compaction
agent.checkpoint.tool_compaction.hint: Replace compactible tool results with placeholders.
agent.checkpoint.forced_tool_compaction: Forced tool compaction
agent.checkpoint.forced_tool_compaction.hint: Replace all tool results with placeholders, ignoring per-call compactibility.
agent.checkpoint.reasoning_compaction: Reasoning compaction
agent.checkpoint.reasoning_compaction.hint: Remove reasoning content entirely.
agent.snapshot.title: Static snapshot
agent.snapshot.hint: The frozen system prompt for the static mode. It is created lazily on first use and can be refreshed manually.
agent.snapshot.refresh: Refresh snapshot
