agent.read.half: What this agent reads
agent.read.half.desc: Which messages this agent sees in its context. A message reaches the agent only when both filters allow it: this read filter and the author's share filter. The "Users" row covers users and agents that identify as users, the "Agents" row covers all other agents.
agent.read.restriction: Reading restriction
agent.read.matrix: From individual agents
agent.share.half: What others read from this agent
agent.share.half.desc: What other readers can read from this agent's messages. A message reaches a reader only when both filters allow it: this share filter and the reader's own read filter. The "Users" row covers readers that identify as users, the "Agents" row covers all other agents.
agent.share.default: Default for everyone
agent.share.matrix: For individual agents
agent.matrix.empty: No other agents in this chat
agent.row.users: Users
agent.row.agents: Agents
agent.facet.visible: Visible
agent.facet.visible.hint: Whether messages are shown to this side at all.
agent.facet.messages_with_tool_calls: Messages with tool calls
agent.facet.messages_with_tool_calls.hint: Include only messages that contain tool calls.
agent.facet.messages_without_tool_calls: Messages without tool calls
agent.facet.messages_without_tool_calls.hint: Include only messages without tool calls.
agent.facet.brief_reasoning: Brief reasoning
agent.facet.brief_reasoning.hint: Show only the first characters of the reasoning content.
agent.facet.reasoning: Full reasoning
agent.facet.reasoning.hint: Show the entire reasoning content (implies brief reasoning).
agent.facet.content: Content
agent.facet.content.hint: Show the main content of the message.
agent.facet.native_attachments: Native attachments
agent.facet.native_attachments.hint: Pass message attachments to the model natively.
agent.facet.attachments: Attachments
agent.facet.attachments.hint: Show attachments as file references injected into the prompt.
agent.facet.tool_call_facts: Tool call facts
agent.facet.tool_call_facts.hint: Show tool call names only.
agent.facet.brief_tool_call_arguments: Brief tool arguments
agent.facet.brief_tool_call_arguments.hint: Show the first characters of tool call arguments.
agent.facet.brief_tool_call_results: Brief tool results
agent.facet.brief_tool_call_results.hint: Show the first characters of tool call results.
agent.facet.tool_call_arguments: Full tool arguments
agent.facet.tool_call_arguments.hint: Show the entire tool call arguments (implies tool call facts).
agent.facet.tool_call_results: Full tool results
agent.facet.tool_call_results.hint: Show the entire tool call results (implies tool call facts).
agent.facet.tool_call_native_attachments: Tool call native attachments
agent.facet.tool_call_native_attachments.hint: Pass tool call attachments to the model natively.
agent.facet.identity: Author identity
agent.facet.identity.hint: How the message author is presented to the reader. Click to cycle through the identities.
