// Prompt contexts (the sections the system prompt is assembled from)

prompt_contexts.available: Available prompt contexts
prompt_contexts.available.hint: The prompt contexts are the sections the system prompt of an agent is assembled from. Fixed contexts are always enabled; the modifiable ones can be switched on and off per agent.
prompt_contexts.refresh: Refresh the list
prompt_contexts.search.placeholder: Search prompt contexts...
prompt_contexts.empty: No prompt contexts found
prompt_contexts.enabled_by_default: Enable prompt contexts by default
prompt_contexts.enabled_by_default.hint: Used for the prompt contexts that have no per-agent override.
chat.prompt_contexts: Prompt contexts
agent.prompt_contexts: Prompt contexts
agent.prompt_contexts.hint: The sections the system prompt is assembled from, in the order they are listed. A switched off context disappears from the system prompt; a context switched on after the prompt was frozen is announced to the agent as a change.
